{"id":"663617","name":"鲜笋艾叶粄","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/663617/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"艾叶","amount":"400g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"600g"},{"name":"粘米粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"食用碱","amount":"2g"},{"name":"小苏打","amount":"2g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"冬笋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"400g"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"1小把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉馅：鲜笋、肉末、香菇、蒜苗，全部切成粒。","img":"images/663617/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧油，倒入肉末。","img":"images/663617/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉末炒干水分后放入香菇。","img":"images/663617/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炒出香气后倒入鲜笋。","img":"images/663617/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入盐、蚝油、酱油、胡椒粉、五香粉调味。","img":"images/663617/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒入味。","img":"images/663617/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后倒入蒜苗。","img":"images/663617/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒出香气出锅。","img":"images/663617/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒好的肉馅备用。","img":"images/663617/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"洗好的艾叶。","img":"images/663617/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烧开一锅水，放入艾叶，加入少量食用碱，保持艾叶的翠绿。","img":"images/663617/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大约煮五分钟后捞出。","img":"images/663617/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入凉水中冷却。","img":"images/663617/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"攥干水分。","img":"images/663617/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"把艾叶放入破壁机，加入适量的清水。","img":"images/663617/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"搅打1分钟。","img":"images/663617/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"打好的艾泥倒入盆内。","img":"images/663617/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"加入糯米粉和粘米粉。","img":"images/663617/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"搓成较硬的面团。","img":"images/663617/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"取几片面团压扁。","img":"images/663617/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放入热水中煮。","img":"images/663617/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"浮起即可。","img":"images/663617/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"煮好的艾团重新放入盆内继续搓匀，可加入一勺猪油防粘手。","img":"images/663617/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"案板表面抹点油，放入面团。","img":"images/663617/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"面团搓成长条。","img":"images/663617/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"切成等量的小剂子，约60克左右。","img":"images/663617/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"取一个面团，中间压个洞。","img":"images/663617/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"再做成一个小窝。","img":"images/663617/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"填入馅料。","img":"images/663617/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/663617/step_30.jpg"},{"step":31,"desc":"搓圆。","img":"images/663617/step_31.jpg"},{"step":32,"desc":"表面捏一个边做装饰。","img":"images/663617/step_32.jpg"},{"step":33,"desc":"包好的艾叶粄。","img":"images/663617/step_33.jpg"},{"step":34,"desc":"上锅蒸十分钟即可。","img":"images/663617/step_34.jpg"},{"step":35,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663617/step_35.jpg"},{"step":36,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663617/step_36.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}